ых задач. Объединяйте инструменты скриптами для многоэтапных задач. Codemode соблюдает те же разрешения и подтверждения, что и Work."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"boundary-moons day","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","div","Plan",{"children":[["$","svg",null,{"className":"moon phase-glyph","viewBox":"0 0 100 100","aria-hidden":"true","focusable":"false","children":[["$","circle",null,{"className":"moon-disc","cx":"50","cy":"50","r":"49.5"}],["$","path",null,{"className":"moon-lit","d":"M 50 0 A 50 50 0 0 0 50 100 A 26.000 50 0 0 1 50 0 Z"}]]}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Plan"}]]}],["$","div","Work",{"children":[["$","svg",null,{"className":"moon phase-glyph","viewBox":"0 0 100 100","aria-hidden":"true","focusable":"false","children":[["$","circle",null,{"className":"moon-disc","cx":"50","cy":"50","r":"49.5"}],["$","path",null,{"className":"moon-lit","d":"M 50 0 A 50 50 0 0 0 50 100 A 0.000 50 0 0 1 50 0 Z"}]]}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Work"}]]}],["$","div","Codemode",{"children":[["$","svg",null,{"className":"moon phase-glyph","viewBox":"0 0 100 100","aria-hidden":"true","focusable":"false","children":[["$","circle",null,{"className":"moon-disc","cx":"50","cy":"50","r":"49.5"}],["$","path",null,{"className":"moon-lit","d":"M 50 0 A 50 50 0 0 0 50 100 A 50.000 50 0 0 0 50 0 Z"}]]}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Codemode"}]]}]]}]]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"day-raised section","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"shell","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"cells","children":[["$","article","01",{"className":"cell","data-reveal":true,"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"kicker","children":"Локальный контекст"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"title","children":"На устройстве, с понятными путями передачи."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Проекты и история разговоров хранятся локально. Нужные запросы, файлы и результаты инструментов могут передаваться выбранной модели или сервису."}]]}],["$","article","02",{"className":"cell","data-reve